WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:35.880
So, Your Highness, do you intend to reconcile with King Somand?

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:38.010
Of course.

00:01:38.230 --> 00:01:43.360
When my brother stops ruling as an iron-fisted dictator and the order banishing me is withdrawn...

00:01:44.510 --> 00:01:47.180
I will serve my brother with pleasure.

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:52.760
My older brother has no idea how grave the state of society is.

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:58.680
If his advisers are going to let him stay that way, then I will have to open his eyes.

00:01:59.960 --> 00:02:02.350
I consider it my duty.

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:05.120
So you're saying, as a first step...

00:02:05.150 --> 00:02:09.160
United Nations inspectors should be allowed into the country...

00:02:10.180 --> 00:02:15.440
- ...but the King is currently refusing their entry?
- He can't refuse them forever.

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:19.420
If nothing were wrong, there wouldn't be unrest among the people.

00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:24.420
And, in the event that the King refuses to comply, what will you do?

00:02:27.510 --> 00:02:32.700
In that event... I will return. I don't care if it's only one...

00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:35.830
...if a voice among my people asks for me...

00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:38.690
...nothing will stop me.

00:02:40.350 --> 00:02:42.130
I will return.

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:46.720
"Missing Piece"

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:59.170
And in the event that the King refuses to comply, what will you do?

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:06.470
In that event... I will return.

00:03:07.070 --> 00:03:09.170
You planned this?

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:11.120
Yes, the basic outline.

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:15.870
And you expressly chose to tape it in Singapore.

00:03:16.310 --> 00:03:21.470
Yes. The people of Raginei will be moved to see His Highness Rumaty risking his own safety...

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:24.140
...to be near his country.

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:26.020
Hm, I see.

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:29.180
And was it also your idea to have it continuously rebroadcast like this?

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:33.830
By repeating it, we'll heighten the wave of sympathy from the people of Raginei.

00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:37.850
Commendable, in both strategy and substance.

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:39.280
Thank you.

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:42.250
And the next step?

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:44.150
Already in motion.

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:47.600
But, knowing His Highness, he's not going to keep doing just as I say...

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:52.180
Well, that's better than a bad actor who can't talk without a script in his hand; no good would come of that.

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:57.180
By the way, have you gotten any updates on Raginei from Carl?

00:03:57.560 --> 00:04:02.530
Apparently there was a massive crack-down on anti-government forces at the beginning of this month.

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:04.970
It's practically a Reign of Terror.

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:08.460
And no one in the palace has realized how bad things are...

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:13.270
...or else somebody is making sure they don't...

00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:16.640
That "somebody" is who Eugene's going there to see...

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:19.060
...via his sister-in-law's connections.

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:21.420
And Kajika hasn't been much trouble?

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:24.590
...because she arrives in Singapore tomorrow.

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:26.590
To join His Highness Rumaty?

00:04:27.150 --> 00:04:28.090
Yes.

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:31.110
I forbade her coming, but it was useless.

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:32.580
I'm sure.

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:34.260
Well, goodbye for now.

00:04:38.110 --> 00:04:40.110
<i>Only this far, though.</i>

00:04:41.110 --> 00:04:43.180
<i>I won't let Kajika go any further.</i>

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:46.780
<i>Because, at any moment, civil war could erupt in Raginei.</i>

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:53.290
M--miss Kajika! You said you were going to the store!

00:04:53.380 --> 00:04:55.280
T--this is...!

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:58.530
Right! Carl's apartment.

00:04:58.950 --> 00:05:02.650
Burnsworth and Rosenthal are rivals!

00:05:02.770 --> 00:05:03.980
What on earth are we here for?

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:07.010
To ask if Mustafa's really safe.

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:10.730
Carl can tell me what's really going on in the Raginei Royal Palace.

00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:17.550
But wow, executives' schedules are supposed to be secret, so how did you figure his out?

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:19.330
I didn't.

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:23.260
So we'll just have to wait, won't we?

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:25.480
With no idea when he's coming back?

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:29.910
No worries! I know for sure he's in New York today.

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:53.190
Are you alright, young master?

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:56.410
Just a little tired.

00:05:56.680 --> 00:05:58.000
And no wonder.

00:05:58.160 --> 00:06:01.670
It's insane, the way you've been going without enough sleep for the last few months.

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:04.030
If you have a goal...

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:06.480
you can leap any hurdle, no matter how high.

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:12.020
<i>By the way, you like Kajika, don't you?</i>

00:06:14.760 --> 00:06:16.640
<i>I'll give her, if you want her.</i>

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:22.000
<i>It is all up to her.</i>

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:24.830
This is the time to stand firm.

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:30.690
My father may be older now, but his spirit's still vigorous.

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:35.430
I've managed to fool his eagle eyes while I make preparations for the coup.

00:06:36.770 --> 00:06:38.840
Since I played the good son for so long...

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:41.300
...he still regards me without suspicion, doesn't he?

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:46.070
Don't worry. The Chairman's inclinations have been thoroughly checked out.

00:06:46.520 --> 00:06:49.130
What's more important today is that you hurry and get some rest.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:50.820
Right... I will.

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:09.730
Is everything alright?

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:10.980
Mm-hmm.

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:21.140
The sun's going down. He's never coming.

00:07:25.510 --> 00:07:27.030
Kajika!

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:29.280
Carl!

00:07:31.020 --> 00:07:32.660
What are you doing here, Kajika?

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:34.590
I had something I wanted to ask you.

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:36.100
Do you have a minute?

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:37.610
Yes, of course.

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:41.250
Uh--um, but...

00:07:41.530 --> 00:07:43.760
Wait here for a bit, Toranosuke.

00:07:44.550 --> 00:07:46.240
It's easier to talk with just two people.

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:49.330
S--sure, but...!

00:08:01.760 --> 00:08:04.050
No one's here, so make yourself at home.

00:08:08.890 --> 00:08:12.110
Wow, you have a lot of room in here. You live alone?

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:16.120
Yes, except for a housekeeper who looks after things for me.

00:08:16.630 --> 00:08:19.090
How about some tea instead of coffee?

00:08:23.900 --> 00:08:26.570
So, what did you want to ask me?

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:30.750
Mustafa is on his way to Raginei.

00:08:30.930 --> 00:08:33.130
Eugene? For what purpose?

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:37.180
He's going to attend King Somand's tea ceremony and meet with Quinza.

00:08:37.590 --> 00:08:39.340
His traditional tea ceremony?

00:08:39.730 --> 00:08:42.120
He's going with a woman named Glücksköld.

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:44.580
Glücksköld?

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:47.530
The Swedish hotel magnates, if I'm not mistaken...

00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:50.110
In that case, there's nothing to worry about.

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:55.430
The royal family appears to be doing everything in their power to promote the Glücksköld's hotel operations.

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:59.540
As long as Eugene is their guest, no one can try anything funny on him.

00:08:59.830 --> 00:09:02.730
Really? If you say so, Carl, that's a relief.

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:07.220
I wanted to go with him, but I'll be in Singapore as of tomorrow.

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:08.600
Singapore?

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:10.530
Yeah, where Rumaty is.

00:09:11.390 --> 00:09:13.090
I saw the interview on TV.

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:16.810
The only image I had had of him from when we met in Raginei was of a bratty kid...

00:09:17.380 --> 00:09:19.420
...but he seemed extremely mature.

00:09:19.640 --> 00:09:21.930
He's studied with Lee-Leng and gone to great pains getting that way.

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:25.570
I mean, really, it's not like anyone is born royal.

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:29.200
Well, you're the American version of an aristocrat...

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:31.210
An aristocrat?

00:09:32.700 --> 00:09:35.700
Dad's Dad, and I'm me.

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:38.720
I'm not a "rubbing elbows with the rich and powerful" kind of girl.

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:42.260
Dad knows it, too, and he leaves me alone about it.

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:47.700
What?

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:51.670
You and your dad really understand each other.

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:53.520
I'm jealous.

00:09:55.890 --> 00:09:57.290
Carl...

00:09:59.010 --> 00:10:04.050
My mother and father may share our blood, but we were beyond perfect strangers.

00:10:04.940 --> 00:10:06.850
All my father wanted from me...

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:11.660
...was for me to excel as successor to the Rosenthal line.

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:14.370
To him, I'm a subordinate.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:18.830
I exist only to protect the fortune he built.

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:22.710
If I were to disappoint him, I would be cast aside.

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:27.110
Carl... that's so...

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:30.610
But in the end, you can't deny blood.

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:37.910
My father has dreams for me, and I...

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:40.840
He's gotten old.

00:10:41.270 --> 00:10:44.600
An inflexible leader whose way of running the company is to pursue his own revenge.

00:10:44.980 --> 00:10:47.020
And that, our foundation doesn't need.

00:10:49.950 --> 00:10:51.640
Carl, stop it!

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:57.470
Such things should never even be put to words! The more you say, the more you'll suffer!

00:10:58.070 --> 00:11:00.680
You can't just open the door and invite sorrow in!

00:11:08.070 --> 00:11:09.310
Kajika...

00:11:18.430 --> 00:11:22.110
Carl! We know you're in there! Stop hiding and get out here!

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:24.100
- Who is that?
- My big sisters.

00:11:24.510 --> 00:11:26.520
- Your sisters?
- Stay here.

00:11:26.850 --> 00:11:28.840
- But--!
- I'll be right back.

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:44.230
- Hey! Get out here, Carl!
- Open up this instant, we need to talk to you!
- Are you in there?

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:48.780
<i>Answer the door! We know you're in there! Carl!</i>

00:11:48.780 --> 00:11:51.170
<i>Open up, Carl!</i>

00:11:56.460 --> 00:11:57.810
OK, what is it?

00:11:58.510 --> 00:12:01.110
How about you give us an explanation?

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:03.360
We call, and we call, and we get ignored!

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:06.110
Yeah! Just who in the hell do you think you are?

00:12:06.170 --> 00:12:08.310
Dad told us the truth!

00:12:08.350 --> 00:12:12.230
Reducing our allowances to a pittance was <i>your</i> idea!

00:12:12.230 --> 00:12:13.820
Oh, sure. And?

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:15.640
What? "Oh, sure?!"

00:12:15.680 --> 00:12:18.980
- My God!
- How dare you just shamelessly say that?!

00:12:18.980 --> 00:12:21.180
<i>Impudent brat! </i>(etc.)<i></i>

00:12:21.180 --> 00:12:25.640
<i>They are Carl's big sisters? They're... intense.</i>

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:29.650
Our father agrees with me on this.

00:12:30.030 --> 00:12:32.960
How exactly is $100,000 dollars a month a pittance?

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:35.250
What, do you think you're head of the family already?

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:38.630
If it came down to it, he could give us the inheritance right now!

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:43.250
- I'm the eldest daughter, I have more right to it than you do! 
- Yeah!

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:47.550
Sisters... don't you think you should take our father a little more seriously?

00:12:49.780 --> 00:12:53.670
Our father, perpetually marrying and divorcing, is an unparalleled skirt-chaser.

00:12:53.920 --> 00:12:56.390
S--so what?

00:12:56.470 --> 00:12:59.690
Even now, he's seeing several women.

00:13:00.260 --> 00:13:05.230
It's entirely possible that out of that group, one of them could end up leading him back to the altar.

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:11.030
So what are you trying to say?

00:13:11.190 --> 00:13:15.080
If he weighed his love for all of you against his love for his new wife...

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:17.460
which do you think would win?

00:13:19.220 --> 00:13:24.470
In that case... it's easy to guess where the bulk of the fortune would go.

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:32.850
I would recommend buttering him up while you still can.

00:13:33.390 --> 00:13:35.840
And meanwhile, I have business to attend to. Please, excuse me.

00:13:45.150 --> 00:13:46.960
Carl!

00:14:11.110 --> 00:14:14.450
Now where did all that vim and vigor go?

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:18.430
It's been umpteen years since it happened, but still... You're pathetic!

00:14:21.650 --> 00:14:24.770
How about crying like you did then, like a little baby bird?

00:14:27.830 --> 00:14:32.000
From the bottom of that well, you were begging me, sobbing...

00:14:32.190 --> 00:14:35.410
"Help!" "Get me out of here!"

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:37.470
Stop it...!

00:14:37.530 --> 00:14:40.860
Trying to control us in father's place?

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:42.940
You have a lot of nerve!

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:44.970
Please, stop!

00:14:45.510 --> 00:14:47.770
STOP!

00:14:51.430 --> 00:14:53.280
Carl!

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:24.500
You damned--!

00:15:28.380 --> 00:15:31.470
- Eek!
- Oh my God!
- My clothes!!

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:35.450
Who the heck is this kid? Your girlfriend?

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:36.860
Idiots!

00:15:36.890 --> 00:15:40.870
Preying on someone else's weakness is lower than low! You should be ashamed!

00:15:42.850 --> 00:15:44.890
Did that cool you down a little?

00:15:45.430 --> 00:15:46.830
Do you want some more?

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:50.300
We'll get you for this!

00:15:58.070 --> 00:16:00.330
I think I overdid it a little.

00:16:01.580 --> 00:16:03.580
Carl! Are you OK?

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:07.500
I--I'm fine. I think it's receding.

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:09.860
It is? I'm so glad.

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:13.780
Carl...

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:21.010
That's the second time I've had you save me.

00:16:22.030 --> 00:16:24.450
You only ever see me at my most pathetic.

00:16:24.730 --> 00:16:27.410
You talk like we're strangers! It's OK.

00:16:28.780 --> 00:16:33.560
I think I told you once that when I was six, I fell down a well.

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:37.990
On the morning of my second day in the well...

00:16:38.650 --> 00:16:40.980
my sisters found me.

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:48.400
Big sis, help! Please!

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:53.630
- Big sis...
- Although I asked for their help, weeping...

00:16:54.140 --> 00:16:56.430
They just sneered down at me.

00:17:01.180 --> 00:17:05.570
It was so cold, so dark... I thought I was going to die.

00:17:07.550 --> 00:17:09.010
Carl...

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:13.340
My mother, who abandoned me at birth...

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:17.130
my sisters, creatures of pure hate...

00:17:17.990 --> 00:17:22.170
At some point, I started to hate the very gender...

00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:28.670
That's how I was... until I met you.

00:17:35.770 --> 00:17:40.960
<i>Even if you can't stop trembling... that's OK. Let your body do what it wants.</i>

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:44.560
<i>There's nothing to be ashamed of.</i>

00:17:45.740 --> 00:17:47.400
<i>Relax...</i>

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:51.410
<i>It's OK... we'll turn all the lights on...</i>

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:55.810
<i>...so you can put your mind at ease...</i>

00:17:56.830 --> 00:17:58.550
...at ease...

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:03.230
Meeting you...

00:18:03.460 --> 00:18:05.110
...changed me.

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:10.650
You're warm.

00:18:15.430 --> 00:18:18.520
I want you by my side.

00:18:25.270 --> 00:18:27.790
You're the only girl...

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:30.210
...I can open my heart to.

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:34.350
Carl...

00:18:37.060 --> 00:18:40.310
I--it must be a shock to hear all of this so suddenly.

00:18:40.520 --> 00:18:41.930
Mm... mm-hmm.

00:18:42.300 --> 00:18:44.830
I'm surprised I said it, too.

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:47.470
But my feelings for you are real.

00:18:48.050 --> 00:18:50.120
I don't mean right away, of course.

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:52.860
Just think about it.

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:55.820
I'll wait...

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:58.720
...forever.

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:05.600
Thank you. I'm glad.

00:19:08.670 --> 00:19:10.220
Can I make one request?

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:12.540
W--what is it?

00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:14.870
Don't talk about me being the only one...

00:19:15.220 --> 00:19:18.660
...instead, try to open your heart to other women, too.

00:19:19.770 --> 00:19:21.240
Kajika...

00:19:21.360 --> 00:19:24.070
You said it was your mother and sisters...

00:19:24.070 --> 00:19:26.340
...that made you hate women.

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:30.000
I know it was painful, but...

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:33.280
...it doesn't make sense to extend your dislike to other women.

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:37.390
Is it true, you really like me?

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:38.730
Yes.

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:41.610
If you put a wall up right away because someone is female...

00:19:42.230 --> 00:19:45.190
...you really hurt your chances of meeting someone wonderful.

00:19:50.770 --> 00:19:52.770
Right.

00:19:54.530 --> 00:19:56.020
<i>Wrong!</i>

00:19:57.230 --> 00:20:00.420
You're still a bud that hasn't bloomed into a flower.

00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:06.410
- You wouldn't understand if I told you.
- <i>Sorry, it's the 29th.</i>

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:10.930
- Any girl that appeared, no matter how wonderful... 
- <i>Well, then, it has nothing to do with us, don't you think?</i>

00:20:11.950 --> 00:20:14.210
...would look dull and faded to me now.

00:20:15.070 --> 00:20:17.460
<i>- Kajika?! 
- It's been a while!</i>

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:20.680
The first spring breeze that touched me is the only one I want.

00:20:21.890 --> 00:20:24.880
That's how deeply I'm in love with you.

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:29.690
And that's why, to get you...

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:32.020
I would do anything!

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:36.540
As long as I can have you by my side...

00:20:37.530 --> 00:20:39.000
I don't care...

00:20:39.490 --> 00:20:42.720
I'll sell my soul to the devil!

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:53.880
Where's Rumaty?

00:20:54.170 --> 00:20:56.430
He's a bit worn out from all the running around.

00:20:57.280 --> 00:21:01.100
I guess King Somand has seen Rumaty's interview by now, huh.

00:21:01.670 --> 00:21:03.140
He's probably pretty mad.

00:21:03.660 --> 00:21:06.710
Reconciliation with King Somand will be difficult, I'm sure.

00:21:07.220 --> 00:21:09.890
His Highness knew that and acted anyway.

00:21:11.230 --> 00:21:15.340
I understand... but it's painful. They're brothers.

00:21:15.560 --> 00:21:17.040
Yes...

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:21.680
...for His Highness Rumaty, who knows what it is to love and to be loved...

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:23.620
...it must hurt deeply.

00:21:26.110 --> 00:21:27.120
What?

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:29.390
That was a weird way of putting it.

00:21:29.610 --> 00:21:33.500
It sounds like you're saying you don't have that kind of a heart yourself.

00:21:35.380 --> 00:21:37.030
Maybe I don't.

00:21:38.560 --> 00:21:42.290
When I was five, my mother passed away in a Swiss sanatorium.

00:21:42.880 --> 00:21:44.990
Right, you've told me before...

00:21:45.050 --> 00:21:48.370
I remember even when they said she'd died, it didn't really hit me.

00:21:49.330 --> 00:21:51.180
I'm a cold-hearted son.

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:53.850
Lee-Leng...

00:21:56.210 --> 00:21:59.330
<i>Back then, Lee-Leng didn't look at anything.</i>

00:21:59.490 --> 00:22:01.620
<i>Just stared around him, glassy-eyed.</i>

00:22:02.830 --> 00:22:05.800
<i>He didn't go to school back then or have any friends...</i>

00:22:05.990 --> 00:22:08.570
<i>...just went through his special gifted student curriculum.</i>

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:19.270
<i>Whenever I remember the look in his eyes, something catches in my throat.</i>

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:24.030
Two more hours to Singapore!

00:22:24.610 --> 00:22:25.750
Yeah...

00:22:31.090 --> 00:22:32.710
<i>They're all lonely...</i>

00:22:33.260 --> 00:22:38.220
<i>Carl... Mustafa... Lee-Leng... Rumaty...</i>

00:22:39.180 --> 00:22:43.450
<i>...even though they're all people others can't help but envy.</i>

00:22:45.360 --> 00:22:47.910
It makes you wonder...

00:22:48.580 --> 00:22:50.520
...what would true happiness be?

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.420 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.330 --> 00:23:27.980
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:29.990 --> 00:23:37.470
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.470 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.830 --> 00:23:52.190
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.190 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.610 --> 00:24:06.810
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
